@page "/goals"

<PageTitle>Goals</PageTitle>

<section class="page-header">
    <p class="dashboard-label">Planning</p>
    <h1>Goals</h1>
    <p>
        This section organizes personal fitness and nutrition goals. It gives the project a clear
        planning area that can later connect to real goal data and user progress.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="feature-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">⚖️</div>
        <h3>Weight Goal</h3>
        <p>
            Track starting weight, target weight, and long-term weight progress.
        </p>
        <div class="goal-pill">Long-term goal</div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🥗</div>
        <h3>Nutrition Goal</h3>
        <p>
            Plan nutrition targets such as daily calories, protein, carbohydrates, and fat intake.
        </p>
        <div class="goal-pill">Nutrition planning</div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🏃</div>
        <h3>Workout Goal</h3>
        <p>
            Set weekly training goals and monitor consistency over time.
        </p>
        <div class="goal-pill">Fitness consistency</div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📅</div>
        <h3>Weekly Review</h3>
        <p>
            Review progress each week and adjust goals based on meals, workouts, and user needs.
        </p>
        <div class="goal-pill">Review cycle</div>
    </div>
</section>